title: Vinyl Cutter
type: text/vnd.tiddlywiki

A machine that cuts shapes from vinyl with a blade, from a vector file. With a pen in the blade holder it works as a [[Pen Plotter]]. See [[Adhocism]].

MICA's Graphic Design department has a Roland GX-24. On a Mac, the only way to drive it is Roland's plugin for Adobe Illustrator, and that plugin doesn't work with Illustrator 2025 or 2026. [[InkCut]] runs it from a [[Pi-Top]] instead.

Used in [[Pi-Top + AxiDraw = Libre Drawing Machine]].
